%h1 Your tickets for #{@event.name}
%p= @event.start_time.in_time_zone.strftime("%B %-d, %Y at %-I:%M %p %Z")
%p
  = "Row #{@reservation.row_id}, seats #{@reservation.seat_range.begin}\u2013#{@reservation.seat_range.end - 1}"
%p
  To view or manage your reservation, sign in with the email used at checkout. We’ll send a one-time code to verify it.
%p
  %a{href: @sign_in_url} Sign in to Seatwise
